        {
          "text": " mbwenu Yesu abagarukaniise na Ruhanga omu mubiri gwe ogw'obuntu ahabw'okufa kwe, ngu abone kubamurika omu maisho ga Ruhanga, muri abarikwera abataine kamogo, kandi abatarikugaywa, ",
